/span><span begin="00:10.355" end="00:11.403">22</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.586" end="00:13.954"><span begin="00:11.586" end="00:11.818">My </span><span begin="00:11.818" end="00:12.259">mind </span><span begin="00:12.426" end="00:12.666">is </span><span begin="00:12.666" end="00:13.211">running </span><span begin="00:13.211" end="00:13.954">circles</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.954" end="00:16.075"><span begin="00:13.954" end="00:14.194">My </span><span begin="00:14.194" end="00:14.770">heart's </span><span begin="00:14.770" end="00:15.043">out </span><span begin="00:15.043" end="00:15.282">in </span><span begin="00:15.282" end="00:15.570">the </span><span begin="00:15.570" end="00:16.075">rain</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.242" end="00:18.815"><span begin="00:16.242" end="00:16.514">I </span><span begin="00:16.514" end="00:16.954">know </span><span begin="00:17.170" end="00:17.386">that </span><span begin="00:17.386" end="00:17.650">this </span><span begin="00:17.650" end="00:17.914">is </span><span begin="00:17.914" end="00:18.498">sudden </span><span begin="00:18.498" end="00:18.815">but</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.815" end="00:23.254"><span begin="00:18.815" end="00:19.262">Do </span><span begin="00:19.454" end="00:19.998">you </span><span begin="00:19.998" end="00:20.566">feel </span><span begin="00:20.566" end="00:21.198">the </span><span begin="00:21.198" end="00:21.790">same </span><span begin="00:21.790" end="00:22.350">same </span><span begin="00:22.350" end="00:22.878">same </span><span begin="00:22.878" end="00:23.254">same</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.469" end="00:26.581"><span begin="00:23.469" end="00:24.029">Do </span><span begin="00:24.029" end="00:24.629">you </span><span begin="00:24.629" end="00:25.197">feel </span><span begin="00:25.197" end="00:25.821">the </span><span begin="00:25.821" end="00:26.581">same</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.184" end="00:30.288"><span begin="00